      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/34/1/294/296",
      "text": [
        "ه عن محمّد بن عثمان العمريّ- قدّس اللّه روحه- فقد رويته عن أبي؛ و محمّد بن الحسن؛ و محمّد بن موسى بن المتوكّل- رضي اللّه عنهم- عن عبد اللّه بن جعفر الحميريّ، عن محمّد بن عثمان العمريّ [قدّس اللّه روحه‌]."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "And whatever is narrated from Muhammad ibn Uthman Al-Amri - may Allah (swt) sanctify his soul - I have narrated it from my father, and from Muhammad ibn Al-Hasan, and from Muhammad ibn Musa ibn Al-Mutawakkil - may Allah (swt) be pleased with them - from Abdullah ibn Jafar Al-Himyari, from Muhammad ibn Uthman Al-Amri - may Allah (swt) sanctify his soul."
        ]
      }
    },
